WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS
------------------------

The MIT terms above apply to the original work in this repository: the
extraction and conversion pipeline in tools/, the JASS interpreter and
simulation in server/, the renderer and interface in client/, the shared
definitions in shared/, and the documentation.

They do not, and cannot, apply to anything else, because none of it is mine
to give and none of it is here:

  * Warcraft III's data, art and audio are Blizzard Entertainment's. The
    archives are not included. The pipeline reads them from your own retail
    installation and everything it derives from them is regenerated locally.

  * "Fight of Characters 7.7b E" is its own author's work. The .w3x is not
    included, and neither is anything extracted from it: the script, the
    object data, the imported models and sounds.

  * Small quotations of the map's text appear in source comments, and in
    server/chatalias.js, where they identify which command a trigger
    registers. They are there to explain the code rather than to reproduce
    the map.

Point this at your own copy of the game and the map and it will build a
playable port. Nothing here is useful, or lawful to distribute, without them.
